1784336880280168	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExkw8		item.comment	bn-3i0w	{"body":"Started in workspace bn-3i0w created from exact approved checkpoint 2bd1dcc5/tree 0087e1f4. Root cause verified against both the frozen r1 bindings and the live r9 attestation: producer RetainedFile.record() wraps the nm authority as {identity, path_chain, trusted_system} while prepare_overlays.py, evidence_schema.py, evaluate.py, and verify_terminal.py all read flat identity keys off the wrapper. prepare_overlays additionally compares open_retained_artifact's flat identity against the wrapper (never equal). Live /usr/bin/nm identity still matches the r9 attestation, so only consumer-side unwrapping is needed; producer format is the reviewed authority format and stays unchanged. Worker implementing strict fail-closed wrapper validation (dev_null-wrapper idiom) plus positive/hostile tests in all four consumers. Note: maw exec auto-sync must not be used on bn-3i0w or bn-znj5 — it refuses/rebases the pinned base; use direct git in the workspace directory."}	blake3:SA_-0fU51-FdkcgtmD9XcaZW0k-IAU56FM5-pdFtu1E
