1784393820092783	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExqA8		item.comment	bn-znj5	{"body":"Prepared r3 failed closed at the late support-import verification, AFTER all four variants + proof-only built successfully (previous two failure modes confirmed fixed). Root cause: prepare_overlays.py:4948 runs the pinned Python with -I but without -B; -I ignores PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE from the environment, so importing frozen evidence_schema wrote artifacts/support/__pycache__/evidence_schema.cpython-314.pyc and the before/after file_manifest guard tripped (evaluator_runtime mutated frozen support files). All other interpreter sites use -I -B (build_children.py:996, evaluate.py:3128, verify_terminal.py:2323). Never reached before: r1 died at nm replay, r2 at variant-B compile. r3 retained diagnostic. Filing bug bone for the one-flag fix + audit of remaining -I sites."}	blake3:oD8ZOB91o8ikhMLzyPhkLjhNFPv1noWwDk6NvBtsqxg
1784393820294684	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExqQ8		item.create	bn-3cyr	{"description":"prepare_overlays.py:4948 invokes the pinned support import runtime with [tool, -I, -c, program] but -I implies -E (ignore env), discarding PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1; the import of the frozen evidence_schema writes __pycache__/evidence_schema.cpython-314.pyc into the frozen support root and the file_manifest before/after guard fails closed with 'evaluator_runtime mutated frozen support files' (prepared r3, retained diagnostic). Fix: add -B to that invocation (matching build_children.py:996, evaluate.py:3128, verify_terminal.py:2323 which all use -I -B). Audit all other python subprocess sites in the four rebaseline files for -I without -B where the program imports from a frozen/manifested root. Add a regression test proving the support-import check leaves the manifest unchanged. Lineage becomes stale after integration; regen required.","kind":"bug","labels":["asterism","benchmark","risk:high"],"title":"Add -B to isolated support-import runtime invocation"}	blake3:cZopWFkeBsKTfKzeekXdBMfFpf2TNW-eSnPrKxFTB-g
