1784741727612579	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAEx_g8		item.create	bn-1gtb	{"description":"bn-2304 added 16 lines to crates/mess-store/src/engine.rs (all before line 1347), which (a) invalidates ENGINE_SHA256 in tooling/current/validate_product_test_overlay.py and (b) shifts every hunk in tooling/current/product-test-overlay.patch, whose apply_in_memory is strictly line-number anchored (old_index = old_start-1 then exact context compare). Verified: TestOwnerCohortGuard 1348->1364, file 4804->4820 (+16), all 17 hunks start >=1347 and are same-size replacements, so a uniform +16 to each hunk's old_start/new_start is correct. Update ENGINE_SHA256 to fe559d6a5d973196023cb03988b75958e6dcbb35530718ddefb6d470c58b19f9. Blocks the bn-d0x6 v4 rehearsal (build_children STEP5 fail-stop: 'exact current engine source SHA-256 differs').","kind":"task","labels":["asterism"],"title":"Rebase product test overlay patch + engine SHA pin after bn-2304 engine.rs fix"}	blake3:TFC7EIr_pC0xwikBuSlSJOcthFRwKQ955rFqWrJwWYM
