1784762280259175	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExkRA		item.comment	bn-d0x6	{"body":"frozen_recheck fix (bn-1csq) merged 9e90532e: retained-ancestor identity trimmed to substitution-stable fields (dev/ino/mode/uid/gid); removes chronic fail-stops from shared-parent (~/.cache) churn -- machine is now usable DURING runs. 3 hostile rename-and-back tests refocused to tolerance; substitution still rejected by symlink+content tests. Progress ladder this session: load(env) -> O(n^2)(bn-5txc) -> correctness-child SIGABRT(bn-2304 via overlay bn-sqr3, reverted trunk to keep pinned-engine invariant) -> engine/overlay pin cascade(bn-1gtb/bn-3hlo, reverted) -> disk floor(preflight) -> frozen_recheck(bn-1csq). v10-r2 rehearsal reached the 32-cell matrix (furthest ever); correctness child now exits 0. Launched v11 rebuild+rehearsal, monitor to follow."}	blake3:bpfD5J58w0jF1SlJoGq89qIBPUT4WZZB3veYxOi-Wrs
1784768815090129	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExkhA		item.create	bn-102d	{"description":"smoke_plans() builds two runtime-role tool smokes (evaluator=asterism-eval+evaluate.py --smoke, terminal_verifier=asterism-term+verify_terminal.py --smoke). _run_contract_smoke runs every smoke plan controlled=True (run_rebaseline.py:8585), so run_child does the boot/ready handshake (10276-10288). But those Python --smoke handlers only write JSON and exit (evaluate.py:22111, verify_terminal.py:13380) - they never send 'boot'. Result: parent boot-read gets EOF -> RunnerFailure 'control socket closed before boot'. Deterministic; verified across rehearsal-v11-r1/r2 (evaluator row 33 has exit_status=0 but interrupted='RunnerFailure: control socket closed before boot'; terminal_verifier never runs). This is the last smoke child before the 32-cell matrix and newly-reached in v11. Fix (diagnosed with a Fable subagent, all sites verified): plumb a controlled flag through ChildPlan (run_rebaseline.py) and run the two runtime-role smokes controlled=False, matching the contract smokes; mirror in evaluate.py's transition binding (binding_transition 5838, RUNNER_SMOKE_RUNTIME_ROLES loop 5864, self-test fixture 13262) since the evaluator cross-checks controlled<->CONTROL_FD via evidence_schema.transition_child_environment (2053-2064). verify_terminal.py unchanged. Rust smokes (correctness/fault/variants) keep controlled=True (they genuinely handshake). Blocks bn-d0x6 rehearsal.","kind":"bug","labels":["asterism"],"title":"v11 runtime-role smokes must run uncontrolled (evaluator/terminal_verifier)"}	blake3:v2e59KfTNioZDRunykkIeniBD7-AGEeCNyjSSL5R41o
