1784769282191570	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExlhA		item.comment	bn-d0x6	{"body":"Tool-smoke fix (bn-102d) merged 2d959fa4. MY MISREAD corrected by Fable subagent: the evaluator did NOT pass - its row had exit_status=0 but interrupted='RunnerFailure: control socket closed before boot'; terminal_verifier never ran. Both runtime-role tool smokes (evaluator/terminal_verifier) ran controlled=True but their Python --smoke handlers don't do the control handshake. Fixed: ChildPlan.controlled flag, runtime-role smokes controlled=False, evaluate.py binding mirrored (CONTROL_FD iff controlled). Self-tests all green. v11 reached child 34 (last smoke before the 32-cell matrix) - furthest ever. Launched v12 rebuild+rehearsal. Progress ladder: env/load, O(n^2)[bn-5txc], correctness-child[bn-2304 via overlay bn-sqr3], pin cascade[bn-1gtb/bn-3hlo], disk floor[preflight], frozen_recheck[bn-1csq], tool-smoke handshake[bn-102d]."}	blake3:Nmdol6XFDciFWyRxD1E1P0-d7gVqEHbMlyinhn-4beo
1784774291481789	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExlxA		item.comment	bn-d0x6	{"body":"MILESTONE: bn-102d tool-smoke fix WORKED - v12 cleared the entire smoke phase (terminal_verifier passed, 35 children) - FIRST TIME EVER past smoke, into specialized-reopen/matrix territory. New blocker: profile_adapters.py was NEVER adapted to v4 (bn-2vih touched run_rebaseline/evaluate/verify_terminal/evidence_schema, not profile_adapters). validate_profile_authority (6624-6968, 28 v3-custody markers) still opens the v3 prepared claims/single-use-claim.json, which v4 relocated to output/run-claim.json (empty claims/ dir in prepared root). fail-stop exit 30: 'cannot establish profile authority: cannot open immutable prepared single-use claim'. Needs the same v4 adaptation bn-2vih did for the runner. Delegating precise diagnosis to Fable subagent; will implement+verify+review."}	blake3:ECVLsR0otGreUkY9WpWeTQ5ZhKQ7oqkZsWpS8Daci84
1784774843451042	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExmBA		item.create	bn-qxb1	{"description":"profile_adapters.py was never adapted to v4 (bn-2vih touched runner/evaluator/verifier/schema only). validate_profile_authority (6624) opens the v3 prepared claims/single-use-claim.json which v4 no longer writes (claim relocated to output/run-claim.json). Fail-stop exit 30 'cannot establish profile authority: cannot open immutable prepared single-use claim'. Fix (Fable-mapped, verified): derive prepared_root lexically from the recorded single_use_claim.path (no file open), keep prepared-root 0555 check, drop the v3 claims/ 0700 + single-use file-existence custody, and replay the SAME 9-field claim record from output/run-claim.json (attempt_prepared_path.with_name('run-claim.json')) - identical schema bn-2l3n-prepared-claim-v3 and fields, frozen+phase-verified by the runner. Preserves all claim cross-checks (prepared_artifacts_path/sha, output_dir, attempt_nonce, lease_nonce) and content-hash grounding of prepared_root; relaxes only single-use-file custody exactly as bn-2vih did. Real coverage is test_profile_adapters.py (runner self-test uses _FakeProfiles). Found by bn-d0x6 v12 rehearsal (first ever past smoke phase).","kind":"bug","labels":["asterism"],"title":"Adapt profile_adapters.py profile authority to protocol v4 (relocated run-claim)"}	blake3:mSrzA-6RN80yp8XZcTve95P6KylKJ2HSYhf6dLqkpUs
