1784775211131860	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExnBA		item.comment	bn-d0x6	{"body":"profile_adapters v4 adaptation (bn-qxb1) merged 49530870: validate_profile_authority replays run-claim.json instead of the v3 prepared claims file. test_profile_adapters 60/60 (real coverage; runner self-test uses _FakeProfiles so bn-2vih missed this). Launched v13 rebuild+rehearsal. Ladder: env/load, O(n^2)[5txc], correctness-child[2304/sqr3], pins[1gtb/3hlo], disk[preflight], frozen_recheck[1csq], tool-smoke handshake[102d], profile-authority claim[qxb1]. v12 got past smoke into profile-authority (specialized-reopen) - furthest ever; v13 should reach the 32-cell matrix."}	blake3:pRllNvprKx5-5kroUq7aBX9O82OzKh1VfoIG1iJNcDM
1784816336937486	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExnRA		item.create	bn-3vvb	{"description":"profile_adapters.py _validate_phase4_semantic_authority (~427 lines) re-validates the source-review/attestation/overlay/lock chain that evidence_schema._validate_source_review_bundle/_input and evaluate.validate_source_review_bundle_authority already validate canonically (run by runner at load_prepared and evaluator at eval). The profile-adapter copy was never adapted through bn-3hch/bn-ecm1/v4 and drifts one check per rebuild (claim relocation, then source-review-input schema bn-ecm1 vs bn-3hch, ~28 more). Remove the phase4 call (inside _validate_release_compile_out_authority ~6407) and the entire dead closure + 78 dead symbols; keep all profile-specific authority (run-claim binding bn-qxb1, prepared-root mode, source-review file bindings/proof/equivalence/nm/forbidden-hook, profile-tool + live-process identity). Fable-mapped and empirically verified: test_profile_adapters 46/46, runner --self-test PASS against the edited adapter, module self-test OK. Security preserved (chain still validated by runner+evaluator); only redundant profile-attach-time re-validation dropped, consistent with v4 pragmatic evidence discipline. Found by bn-d0x6 v13 rehearsal.","kind":"task","labels":["asterism"],"title":"Remove redundant stale Phase-4 re-validation from profile_adapters profile authority"}	blake3:cNcyrg3qoil0b14ahMUvuQ1yvtDPCV-NP29Vyokbm-o
