1784982721462628	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExwhA		item.create	bn-3pym	{"description":"First real structural_traces measurement cell (child 822) child panics 'missing ASTERISM_PAYLOAD_BYTES': Runner.evidence_plans enriches batches_per_writer for primary/cpu/syscall/new_names/fairness but structural_traces new_names falls to the bare else with no payload_size/batch_size/batches_per_writer, so the env vars are absent and configured_workload panics. reopen is already wired (separate corpus path). Fix (two-sited, mirrors batches_per_writer precedent): add structural_traces new_names branch in run_rebaseline.evidence_plans AND evaluate.expected_context setting payload_size=250, batch_size=1, batches_per_writer=appends_per_writer(8). Python-only; do NOT touch structural_trace_rows (self-test mirror) or reopen.","kind":"task","title":"Enrich structural_traces new_names context with payload/batch/batches_per_writer"}	blake3:gamxtTTNv15jUNto2EcfIMCNUX1_qPnKh7Zq-ELIEjM
