1785003689286350	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExxBA		item.comment	bn-2l3n	{"body":"SHELVED 2026-07-25 (Bob's decision). The asterism attestation protocol (bn-3nl7/bn-d0x6, spikes/asterism_rebaseline) grew from this medium 'benchmark, risk:low' task into a multi-week cryptographic-attestation apparatus whose self-validation became the entire job (~19 harness fail-stops fixed in one overnight session, each an anti-tamper check unrelated to engine performance). For iterating on the planned phase changes we are switching to crates/mess-bench (bn-4pk envelope regression suite: ledger + floors.json ratchet) — proportionate, real-fs, minutes per run, no attestation. Asterism reserved for a future tamper-proof PUBLISHED baseline only if an external party ever needs to trust the numbers without trusting us. Harness state left intact under ~/.cache/mess-bench (reclaimable)."}	blake3:v36Bot0LdHrH7RRGK1HKCFpJqjxg8NJlvU69SD1jZgM
