1785542169031766	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExuhE		item.comment	bn-34as	{"body":"Phase 6 closed DECLINED via premise check (bn-3hm4) — zero production microblock code built. The phase's premise was Spike F's component-level 2.2-5.3x apply win; the composed engine calls apply_committed once per batch (not per event), so the entire ActiveIndex accounts for 0.0006-0.50% of engine time across the reference suite and the best-case end-to-end gain is +0.40% — unresolvable by the instrument that would have judged admission. Same arc as Phase 5/dense heads: the gate bone (bn-1cwy) was scheduled after four size-m risk:high construction bones; running the measurement first cost one bone and ~20 minutes of bench time. ActiveIndex (map-of-vectors) stays. Reopen-time bulk apply is the only place ActiveIndex shows double-digit share (18.6% of a 31ms one-shot in a degenerate 1-event-batch shape) — noted for the record, not worth a phase. Coverage gap filed separately: the reference suite has no live-tail/global-position read workload, so global_range/global_committed and hot multi-stream read_stream are unmeasured."}	blake3:48tQ6P6sl6PJrNfSEGcmycNi0eAfdBEmjyblYMewoQw
1785542169154541	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExuxE		item.create	bn-1r9c	{"description":"The reference suite has no workload that reads the global position stream live (global_range/global_committed on ActiveIndex) or pages hot multi-stream read_stream data — the bn-3hm4 premise check found these paths entirely unexercised (zero calls across all nine workloads). This is the standard subscriber/catch-up consumer shape: N readers paging read_global from a moving position while a writer appends. Same pattern as bn-1dlb (reader_contention): a workload bone whose value is making a blind spot measurable, with floors seeded loose (~half measured) after first runs. Independent of the declined Phase 6 — globals stay stride-1 regardless; this is about the suite seeing the read path at all.","kind":"task","title":"mess-bench: add a live-tail / global-position read workload (coverage gap found by bn-3hm4)"}	blake3:5Tt_kkX5_UVcF2A311git2sCqB3G59e5XfFkZWRW4tw
